      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Every month, except September, Pearl’s community center hosts a Bluegrass festival on the first Saturday, drawing music lovers from across the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pearl%2C_Texas",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Right after San Antonio’s Battle of Flowers, Pearl’s Viva Pearl Fiesta offers live music, DJ sets, salsa lessons, and local vendor stalls for families.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://pearldistrictsanantonioneighborhood.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Strolling Pearl’s pedestrian‑friendly streets reveals a striking blend of early‑20th‑century industrial buildings and thoughtfully designed contemporary homes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://pearldistrictsanantonioneighborhood.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Inside the historic brewhouse, Southerleigh Fine Food & Brewery serves Gulf Coast‑inspired cuisine and award‑winning craft beers brewed on site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
